            -- operand. Reject the non-null keywords on non-boolean columns here so they
            -- don'[REDACTED]'null'[REDACTED]'boolean'[REDACTED]'is % filter requires a boolean column, got %'[REDACTED]'like'[REDACTED]'ilike'[REDACTED]'~~'[REDACTED]'operator % requires a text-compatible column type, got %'[REDACTED]'match'[REDACTED]'imatch'[REDACTED]'imatch'[REDACTED]'~*'[REDACTED]'~'[REDACTED]'boolean'[REDACTED]'operator % requires a text-compatible column type, got %'[REDACTED]'invalid regular expression for % filter: %'[REDACTED]'invalid column for select %'[REDACTED]'t be tricked by a
